{
  "voice": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
  "model": "eleven_v4",
  "format": "mp3_44100_128",
  "voice_settings": {
    "stability": 0.4,
    "similarity_boost": 0.75
  },
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "01-title",
      "text": "What if your car could fly? Tesla says this one can.",
      "file": "01-title.mp3",
      "align": "01-title.align.json",
      "seconds": 4.08,
      "speech_start": 0.14,
      "speech_end": 3.9,
      "hash": "aa63c2757e83dfcc",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-ramp",
      "text": "Here's what the new Roadster actually did.",
      "file": "02-ramp.mp3",
      "align": "02-ramp.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.8,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 2.3,
      "hash": "f56b189a206c33ea",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-how",
      "text": "It drove upside down, then flew off the end. So how does a car hang from the ceiling, when a plane can't?",
      "file": "03-how.mp3",
      "align": "03-how.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.65,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.16,
      "hash": "6571696a851aab16",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-three",
      "text": "There are only three ways to beat gravity. The first is a wing.",
      "file": "04-three.mp3",
      "align": "04-three.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.02,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 4.32,
      "hash": "1041397fba68cb57",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-lift",
      "text": "A wing pushes air down as it moves, and the air pushes back up. That's lift.",
      "file": "05-lift.mp3",
      "align": "05-lift.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.9,
      "speech_start": 0,
      "speech_end": 5.48,
      "hash": "586f484ddb5a9578",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-inverted",
      "text": "And yes, planes can fly upside down. Stunt planes just tip the nose up, so the wing keeps pushing air down.",
      "file": "06-inverted.mp3",
      "align": "06-inverted.align.json",
      "seconds": 8.23,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.62,
      "hash": "9ccc35f3c8e23eb6",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-stall",
      "text": "But lift needs speed. Slow down, and the wing has nothing to push against. A wing can't just hang there.",
      "file": "07-stall.mp3",
      "align": "07-stall.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.65,
      "speech_start": 0.06,
      "speech_end": 7.06,
      "hash": "3e91a44eb79f7f7e",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-suction",
      "text": "The Roadster uses the second way. Suction.",
      "file": "08-suction.mp3",
      "align": "08-suction.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.66,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 3.04,
      "hash": "47a87efce0973b73",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-fans",
      "text": "Fans pull the air out from under the car, so the air around it presses harder than the air beneath. Tesla says that's up to two g's of pull.",
      "file": "09-fans.mp3",
      "align": "09-fans.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.06,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 9.44,
      "hash": "25b968edf70fccdf",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-tenth",
      "text": "And it doesn't take much. Less than a tenth of normal air pressure, across the floor of a car, holds it to the ceiling. Even when it's going slow.",
      "file": "10-tenth.mp3",
      "align": "10-tenth.align.json",
      "seconds": 9.51,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 8.78,
      "hash": "f1728e5eea9eb380",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "11-leave",
      "text": "But suction needs a surface. Leave the ramp, and nothing's holding you.",
      "file": "11-leave.mp3",
      "align": "11-leave.align.json",
      "seconds": 5.09,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 4.56,
      "hash": "6ac96ba984e9ae46",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "12-thrust",
      "text": "So, the third way. Thrust.",
      "file": "12-thrust.mp3",
      "align": "12-thrust.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.11,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 2.46,
      "hash": "a3043eed85f67447",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-nozzles",
      "text": "Ten nozzles blast compressed air from about six hundred litres of tanks. Throw air one way, and the car goes the other. That's how it rolled over in mid-air.",
      "file": "13-nozzles.mp3",
      "align": "13-nozzles.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.71,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 9.88,
      "hash": "2c97c5f62ea71ea5",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "14-hover",
      "text": "So could it just hover? Here's the catch.",
      "file": "14-hover.mp3",
      "align": "14-hover.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "speech_start": 0.12,
      "speech_end": 2.96,
      "hash": "252d69f593ff9c5b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "15-seconds",
      "text": "Holding a car up takes something like thirty kilos of air, every second. Those tanks hold a few hundred at most. So you get seconds. Not minutes.",
      "file": "15-seconds.mp3",
      "align": "15-seconds.align.json",
      "seconds": 10.79,
      "speech_start": 0.08,
      "speech_end": 10.14,
      "hash": "169272c51d4d302b",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "16-heli",
      "text": "A helicopter hovers all day by pushing on the air around it. The Roadster carries its air in a bottle.",
      "file": "16-heli.mp3",
      "align": "16-heli.align.json",
      "seconds": 7.26,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 6.76,
      "hash": "064d89c01539ced7",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "17-hop",
      "text": "So it doesn't fly like a plane. It hops.",
      "file": "17-hop.mp3",
      "align": "17-hop.align.json",
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 2.8,
      "hash": "91c25b661b6093fd",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "18-real",
      "text": "What's real: a car that clings upside down and jumps on air thrusters, on a closed test site. What's still a promise: production in twenty twenty-eight, and a flying mode that isn't road legal.",
      "file": "18-real.mp3",
      "align": "18-real.align.json",
      "seconds": 13.9,
      "speech_start": 0.1,
      "speech_end": 13.46,
      "hash": "046c42be7af16a53",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "19-end",
      "text": "So… would you ride in it upside down?",
      "file": "19-end.mp3",
      "align": "19-end.align.json",
      "seconds": 2.95,
      "speech_start": 0.16,
      "speech_end": 2.7,
      "hash": "d242a7fb2ceabb34",
      "verified": true,
      "timing": "forced-alignment"
    }
  ]
}
